    ],
    "summary": "This errata replaces 2 parts of the Strength from Death rule of the Devoted of Ynnead detachment:\n\n- Lethal Intent: as your opponent's Shooting phase ends, if 1 or more **YNNARI** units of yours were **destroyed** in it, pick 1 **YNNARI INFANTRY** or **YNNARI MOUNTED** unit of yours that was no more than 6\" from a destroyed unit; it may make a **Normal move** capped at D6+1\".\n- Lethal Surge: once per turn, a **YNNARI** unit of yours performing Fade Back (an Agile Manoeuvre) may surge as far as D6+1\" in place of its Normal move.",
